## FloatingIPsApi

### Place a real Floating IP order, create billing records, and provision the service
## Place a real Floating IP order, create billing records, and provision the service
POST https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/floating_ips/order
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

{
 "serviceType": "<number>",
 "coupon": "<string>",
 "comment": "<string>"
}


### Cancel a Floating IP service and release the IP — destructive, billing stops
## Cancel a Floating IP service and release the IP — destructive, billing stops
DELETE https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/floating_ips/{{id}}
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

